---
---

<section class="relative bg-[var(--color-bg-offwhite)] h-[50vh] flex flex-col justify-center">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 w-full">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <!-- Image -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 relative">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -right-3 -top-3 w-16 h-16 border-2 border-[var(--color-burgundy)] z-0 hidden lg:block"></div>
          <div class="relative img-tint border-2 border-[var(--color-primary-blue)] z-10">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/lasale-director/500/500.jpg" alt="Executive Director" class="w-full h-[280px] lg:h-[340px] object-cover duotone-img" />
            <div class="img-badge">Executive Director</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
          <div class="w-8 h-[2px] bg-[var(--color-burgundy)]"></div>
          <span class="font-display font-500 text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.28em] uppercase text-[var(--color-burgundy)]">Section I · Director's Preface</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-[1.8rem] lg:text-[2.2rem] leading-[1.06] mb-6 text-[var(--color-primary-blue)]">
          <span class="drop-cap">S</span>ambutan Direktur Eksekutif
        </h2>
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[var(--color-accent-yellow)] pl-5 mb-6">
          <p class="font-body text-[1rem] text-[var(--color-ink)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
            "Selamat datang di LaSALe. Sejak 1987, kami menjadi wadah bagi mahasiswa hukum untuk mengembangkan kompetensi praktis — dari konsultasi hukum masyarakat hingga literasi hukum nasional."
          </p>
          <p class="font-body text-[0.92rem] text-[var(--color-ink)]/70 leading-relaxed">
            "Bergabunglah bersama kami. Bersama, kita bangun masa depan praktik hukum Indonesia."
          </p>
        </blockquote>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-[var(--color-primary-blue)] flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-display font-700 text-[var(--color-accent-yellow)] text-base">L</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display font-600 text-[var(--color-primary-blue)] text-[0.95rem]">Executive Director</div>
            <div class="font-body text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink)]/65">LaSALe FH UI — BEM FH UI 2026</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
